<div class="article_content content" id="7679044_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7679045 child"
      id="7679045"
      data-guid="7679045"
      data-parent-guid="7679044"
      data-position="1019"
      data-full-title="§ 42-82: Establishment."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7679045_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7679045_label" for="7679045_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7679045"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 42-82
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7679045"
    >
Establishment.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7679045" data-guid="7679045"></div>
        <div id="questions-7679045" data-guid="7679045" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7679045_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The Common Council, in order to preserve and protect places, sites, buildings, structures, works of art and other objects having a special character or special historic or aesthetic interest or value, does deem it in the best interest of the City of Albany that there hereby be established an Historic Resources Commission, with the powers and duties described herein.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7679046 child"
      id="7679046"
      data-guid="7679046"
      data-parent-guid="7679044"
      data-position="1020"
      data-full-title="§ 42-83: Purpose and intent."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7679046_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7679046_label" for="7679046_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7679046"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 42-83
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7679046"
    >
Purpose and intent.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7679046" data-guid="7679046"></div>
        <div id="questions-7679046" data-guid="7679046" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7679046_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The Historic Resources Commission shall administer the provisions of this article so as to:</div><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="7679047"><a alt="42-83A" class="litem_number" href="7679047#7679047" onclick="return false;" title="42-83A">A. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Regulate the appearance, style and components of new construction in historic districts and of additions or alterations to landmarks or to existing structures which are visible from the public right-of-way within designated historic districts and adjacent areas.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7679048"><a alt="42-83B" class="litem_number" href="7679048#7679048" onclick="return false;" title="42-83B">B. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Protect, preserve and enhance those places, sites, buildings, structures, objects and significant public interiors which are of special character or interest to the City of Albany.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7679049"><a alt="42-83C" class="litem_number" href="7679049#7679049" onclick="return false;" title="42-83C">C. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Foster civic beauty.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7679050"><a alt="42-83D" class="litem_number" href="7679050#7679050" onclick="return false;" title="42-83D">D. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Foster civic pride in the accomplishments of the past.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7679051"><a alt="42-83E" class="litem_number" href="7679051#7679051" onclick="return false;" title="42-83E">E. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Protect and enhance the attractiveness of the City of Albany to visitors and the support and stimulus to the economy thereby provided.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7679052"><a alt="42-83F" class="litem_number" href="7679052#7679052" onclick="return false;" title="42-83F">F. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Foster harmonious, orderly and compatible physical development within the City of Albany.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7679053"><a alt="42-83G" class="litem_number" href="7679053#7679053" onclick="return false;" title="42-83G">G. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Safeguard and preserve the historic, cultural, architectural and archaeological heritage of the City of Albany.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7679054 child"
      id="7679054"
      data-guid="7679054"
      data-parent-guid="7679044"
      data-position="1028"
      data-full-title="§ 42-84: (Reserved)"
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
